This feature enables the OpenVINO GPU plugin on Intel x86 platforms.
It activates the meta-clang-revival layer and installs Intel compute
runtime components (intel-graphics-compiler, intel-compute-runtime,
gmmlib, level-zero) required for GPU-accelerated inference.

This feature requires feature/openvino, see file "require".

To use this feature, add

    --templates feature/openvino-gpu

#@TYPE: Wrtemplate
#@NAME: openvino-gpu
#@DESCRIPTION: Enable OpenVINO GPU plugin with Intel compute runtime on intel-x86 platforms.
